Also known as //ZyXEL Armor Z2 AC2600//. The hardware is very similar to the ZyXEL NBG6816 (Armor Z1), but uses an all QCA IPQ8065 design (SOC and QCA9984 wlan) instead, like the [[toh:netgear:r7800|Netgear Nighthawk x4s (r7800)]] and the Synology rt2600ac.

