==== Network interfaces ====
The default network configuration is:
^ Interface Name   ^ Description          ^ Default configuration    ^
| br-lan           | LAN & WiFi           | 192.168.1.1/24           |
| eth1.1 (vlan1)   | LAN ports (1 to 4)   | None                     |
| eth0.2 (vlan2)   | WAN                  | DHCP                     |
| wlan0            | 5Ghz WiFi            | Disabled                 |
| wlan1            | 2.4Ghz WiFi          | Disabled                 |

</WRAP>

==== Switch Ports (for VLANs) ====
<WRAP BOX>

Numbers 1-4 are Ports 1-4 as labeled on the unit, number 5 is the Internet (WAN) on the unit. The router uses two CPU ports from the switch, 0 is the internal connection between WAN and the router itself, while 6 is used for the internal connection between LAN and the router itself.
^ Port             ^ Switch port   ^
| Internet (WAN)   | 5     |
| LAN 1            | 1     |
| LAN 2            | 2     |
| LAN 3            | 3     |
| LAN 4            | 4     |

</WRAP>

